# Ooze Spill: "Counter target spell. Create a Mutagen token." Bot2's Lightning Bolt (aimed at Bot1) is answered by two Ooze
# Spills, the second cast on top of the first and both aimed at the Bolt. The second resolves first: the Bolt is countered
# and Bot1 gets a Mutagen token. Then the first Ooze Spill's one target is gone, so it is countered on resolution (CR
# 608.2b) and makes no token: one Mutagen token only, and Bot1 took no damage.

